      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a profound realization, and you're tapping into the core of what's often called existential dread. That feeling of meaninglessness is a very real and very honest response to the vast indifference of the universe. If the grand cosmic script is empty, perhaps the performance itself is the only thing you have control over—and maybe the purpose is simply to choose the most beautiful, or most honest, way to play your part, even if the audience is silent.",
